    "description": "\r\n[unlaunched[]]A personal[white[]] Serpulo campaign rework. Designed to be [#6d72af[]]a love letter[white[]] for those new to this game. \r\nHas [sky[]]minor buffs[white[]] on few vanilla weak blocks.\r\nThis mod is fixed at [sky[]]NORMAL[white[]] difficulty and cannot be changed.\r\n[sky[]]Contains 55+[white[]] sectors!\r\nAll maps are Serpulo environment compatible.\r\n\r\n[#c5cbff[]]Have fun[white[]].\r\n\r\n\r\nUpdate log: V0.7 -- Stage 6-1 to 6-5 added. Multiple bugfixes, added more text hints in previous sectors.\r\n\r\n--Credits--\r\n[#cccccc[]]Coding:Everdusk22\r\nSector icon:Seabed\r\nMusic selection:しかみど☆\r\nBundle Polish:Plooey\r\n",
